      "comment": "ZIPPING SNEAD (1) boasts a consistent overall record including nine wins from 43 starts, the latest hitting the minor money when third (30.04) over 520m at this track. Form at the trip sound including two wins. Happy to have him on top this line-up. ZIPPING JAMAL (2) hit the frame in a Grade 5 two back then found trouble in the run last time and fell at Wentworth Park. Can do much better this time. WINSOME JUMBO (6) broke a three run winning streak last start when fifth and beaten 6 lengths (30.07) last time at Wentworth Park. Has never been out of the money in three starts this course and distance. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. PSYCHO CIRCUS (8) has ability and must be included among the main hopes.",
